          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakuso isithunywa sebandla eliseSardisi loba uthi: Nanku akutshoyo lowo olabomoya abayisikhombisa bakaNkulunkulu lezinkanyezi eziyisikhombisa, uthi: Ngiyayazi imisebenzi yakho ukuba kuthiwa uyaphila, kanti wena ufile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vuka, uqinise okuseleyo osekuzakufa, ngoba kangifumananga imisebenzi yakho iphelelisiwe phambi kukaNkulunkulu wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumbulake lokho okwamukeleyo wakuzwa, kugcine, uphenduke. Uba ungavuki, ngizakuza kuwe njengesela, kawusoze wasazi isikhathi engizakuza ngaso kuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
